@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@token = PEGAR_TOKEN_AQUI

### Salud
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health

### Iniciar sesión
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "Cambiar123!"
}

### Usuario actual
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Listar roles
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear usuario de recepción
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "recepcion01",
  "password": "Recepcion123!",
  "fullName": "Personal de recepción",
  "email": "recepcion@example.com",
  "roles": ["RECEPCION"]
}

### Desactivar usuario
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/2/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "active": false
}

### Crear solicitud pública (no crea una cita)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/public/appointment-requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Ana Torres",
  "documentNumber": "70000001",
  "mobile": "999999999",
  "email": "ana@example.com",
  "service": "Evaluación general",
  "preferredDate": "2026-09-10",
  "preferredShift": "TARDE",
  "message": "Primera consulta",
  "privacyConsent": true
}

### Listar solicitudes web
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/appointment-requests?status=PENDIENTE
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Agenda de una semana
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/appointments?from=2026-09-01T05:00:00Z&to=2026-09-08T05:00:00Z
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Borradores del copiloto
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/copilot/drafts?encounterId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Generar verificación de cierre
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/copilot/drafts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "encounterId": 1,
  "type": "VERIFICACION_CIERRE"
}

### Resumen operativo y financiero
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/summary?from=2026-09-01T05:00:00Z&to=2026-10-01T05:00:00Z
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Auditoría
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/audit?from=2026-09-01T05:00:00Z&to=2026-10-01T05:00:00Z&page=0&size=30
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
